# OpenWrt 25.12.6 kernel module packages (apk v3) the image takes for the firewall (nftables) and its NFLOG log viewer.
# board = qualcommax/ipq60xx (installed into the GL-AX1800 image: the stock root lacks nfnetlink_log, which the
#         firewall's `log group` rules need, so the whole netfilter set comes from these pinned packages);
# virt  = armsr/armv8 (same 6.12.112 kernel release, only for the QEMU gate's test copy of the root).
# The set is the dependency closure of kmod-nft-core kmod-nft-nat kmod-nft-fib kmod-nft-offload kmod-nfnetlink-log
# (apk adbdump depends). Bump = new kmods dir + sha256 lines; fetch-kmods.sh refuses anything else.
KMOD_URL_board=https://downloads.openwrt.org/releases/25.12.6/targets/qualcommax/ipq60xx/kmods/6.12.112-1-b5fefb5a894e3008353ac9f988245f52
